<%# locals: (person: nil) %>
<%# The words of the applicant notice (MessagesConcern#refuse_applicant). With a
    person it tells a manager or the HQ window what to do, as an error; without
    one it tells the applicant, on their own page, when messages open, which is
    information and no alert. The status prints as stored. The list addresses
    are long, so they wrap as _messages_panel's do. %>
<% if person %>
  <%= ui_callout_box :error do %>
    <strong>Applicants are not allowed to send or receive messages.</strong>
    <%= person.callsign %>'s status is <%= person.status %>. Direct them to the Mentor Shack, or have them
    email the Mentor Cadre at <%= mail_to EmailAddresses::MENTOR_CADRE, nil, class: "wrap-anywhere" %> or the
    Volunteer Coordinators at <%= mail_to EmailAddresses::VOLUNTEER_COORDINATORS_TEAM, nil, class: "wrap-anywhere" %>.
  <% end %>
<% else %>
  <%= ui_callout_box :info, role: "note" do %>
    <strong>Once you become a Ranger, you will be able to message your fellow Rangers.</strong>
    Until then, email the Volunteer Coordinators at
    <%= mail_to EmailAddresses::VOLUNTEER_COORDINATORS_TEAM, nil, class: "wrap-anywhere" %> with any questions.
  <% end %>
<% end %>
